<!-- 模块职责：工单状态和飞书同步；未知结果先核对，禁止盲目重发。 -->
<script setup>
import Icon from '../components/Icon.vue'
import StatusBadge from '../components/StatusBadge.vue'
import { dateTime, label } from '../format'
const props = defineProps({ store: Object })
const store = props.store, s = store.state, isManager = store.manager
</script>
<template>
  <section v-if="!isManager" class="card permission-card"><span class="empty-icon"><Icon name="ticket" :size="30" /></span><h2>工单管理需要负责人身份</h2><p>员工请在任务详情中刷新处理结果。正式工单查询、状态变更和飞书同步由负责人操作。</p></section>
  <template v-else><section class="card search-card"><div><h2>查找正式工单</h2><p>输入执行成功后返回的 TK- 开头编号。</p></div><form class="inline-form" @submit.prevent="store.loadTicket"><Icon name="search" :size="18" /><input v-model="s.ticketInput" aria-label="正式工单编号" :disabled="s.busy" placeholder="输入 ticket_id" /><button class="button primary" :disabled="s.busy || !s.ticketInput.trim()">查询工单</button></form></section>
  <section v-if="!s.ticket" class="card empty-state tall-empty"><span class="empty-icon"><Icon name="ticket" :size="30" /></span><h3>从建议，到有编号的正式工单</h3><p>审核通过后，需通过受控接口正式执行。<br />已经创建的工单可以在这里管理和同步。</p></section>
  <div v-else class="two-column"><section class="card"><div class="card-header"><div><h2>发货延迟核查工单</h2><p class="mono selectable">{{ s.ticket.ticket_id }}</p></div><StatusBadge :status="s.ticket.status" /></div><div class="card-body"><dl class="detail-list"><dt>订单编号</dt><dd class="mono">{{ s.ticket.order_id }}</dd><dt>审核编号</dt><dd class="mono selectable">{{ s.ticket.approval_id }}</dd><dt>创建时间</dt><dd>{{ dateTime(s.ticket.created_at) }}</dd><dt>审核人</dt><dd>{{ s.ticket.reviewer_id }}</dd><dt>执行人</dt><dd>{{ s.ticket.executed_by }}</dd></dl><h3 class="subheading">工单描述</h3><div class="prose-box">{{ s.ticket.description }}</div><div class="button-row section-divider"><button class="button primary small" :disabled="s.busy || !s.ticketReady || s.ticket.status !== 'open' || ['unknown', 'in_progress'].includes(s.sync?.status)" @click="store.changeStatus('in_progress')">标记处理中</button><button class="button secondary small" :disabled="s.busy || !s.ticketReady || s.ticket.status === 'closed' || ['unknown', 'in_progress'].includes(s.sync?.status)" @click="store.changeStatus('closed')">关闭工单</button><button class="text-button" :disabled="s.busy" @click="store.loadTicket">重新查询</button></div><p class="footnote">本地状态更新不会自动写入飞书；关闭后不能重新打开。</p><h3 class="subheading">状态变更记录</h3><div v-if="!s.ticketHistory.length" class="small-empty">暂无状态变更记录。</div><div v-for="item in s.ticketHistory" :key="item.change_id" class="audit-row"><Icon name="check" :size="16" /><div><strong>{{ label(item.previous_status) }} → {{ label(item.status) }}</strong><small>{{ item.changed_by }} · {{ dateTime(item.created_at) }}</small></div></div></div></section>
  <aside><section class="card feishu-card"><div class="card-header"><div class="inline-heading"><span class="feishu-mark"><Icon name="cloud" :size="22" /></span><h2>飞书同步</h2></div><span class="chip">外部系统</span></div><div class="card-body"><template v-if="s.sync"><StatusBadge :status="s.sync.status" /><dl class="detail-list stacked"><dt>远端记录编号</dt><dd class="mono selectable">{{ s.sync.record_id || '尚未确认' }}</dd><dt>最近尝试</dt><dd>{{ dateTime(s.sync.updated_at) }}</dd><dt>尝试次数</dt><dd>{{ s.sync.attempts }}</dd></dl><div v-if="s.sync.error" class="inline-error">{{ s.sync.error }}</div><p class="footnote">显示最近一次同步结果。本地工单发生变化后，需要显式重新同步。</p></template><p v-else class="muted">尚无同步记录。同步会将正式工单写入后端配置的飞书测试表。</p><div class="vertical-buttons"><button class="button primary full-width" :disabled="s.busy || !s.ticketReady || ['unknown', 'in_progress'].includes(s.sync?.status)" @click="store.syncTicket(false)"><Icon name="cloud" :size="17" />同步到飞书</button><button class="button secondary full-width" :disabled="s.busy || !s.sync || s.sync.status === 'success'" @click="store.syncTicket(true)">只读核对远端结果</button></div><p v-if="['unknown', 'in_progress'].includes(s.sync?.status)" class="footnote warning-text">结果尚未确认，已阻止重复写入。请先核对远端记录。</p></div></section></aside></div></template>
</template>
